    "date": 1744721401,
    "caption": "🌐 From Central Eurasia to Silicon Valley: Building the Bridge in the AI Age.\n\nWe’re proud and honored to take the stage at Harvard Kennedy School for a high-level panel discussion that shines a spotlight on Central Eurasia’s innovation ecosystem. This is an important moment to get the chance to share our progress and ideas on a global platform.\n\n🌍 Together with IT Park Uzbekistan, Astana Hub (Kazakhstan), Silkroad Innovation Hub (Silicon Valley), and the Central Asian & Turkic States Caucasus Organization, we’ll explore:\n• Exploration of global economic trends and their regional impact\n• Development of a Blueprint for Shared Prosperity\n• A Call to Action to drive innovation and cross-border collaboration\n• Real-world insights on empowering founders and accelerating startups\n\n📍 Bell Hall (B-500), 5th Floor, Harvard Kennedy School\n🗓️ April 22, 2025 | 3:00 PM – 5:00 PM\n\n🎓 Open to: students, entrepreneurs, researchers, faculty, and the Central Eurasian community in Cambridge and Boston.\n\nThis is a big step forward for Central Asia — and we’re grateful for the chance to represent our region on the global stage.\n\n👉 Curious about emerging markets? Passionate about innovation? Eager to connect with the local ecosystem? This session is for you.\n\n🔗 Register via the link in bio.",
